    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door to a long-forgotten fridge and become a true sanitation hero!<br>In this meditative arcade game, you control a guy with pressure stream to clean off mold that has taken over food, shelves, drawers and even the freezer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure stream mechanics. Aim, spray, and switch between different cleaning types. Blast away mold, push back enemies, and leave sparkling cleanliness behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied locations, dirty objects, and\u00a0rewards. Clean food, treasures, fridge, kitchen items, sewer stuff, and basements. Unlock new heroes, music, and cosmetic items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of dirt and mold to clean: colorful, iridescent, ghost, inverted, sticky, mimic, crystalline, glowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute\u00a0food heroes. You're not a knight or soldier, you\u2019re a healthy meal on a mission. Play as sensible meals determined to defeat mold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill soundtrack and satisfying cleaning sounds make for a strangely addictive and calming experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door to a long-forgotten fridge and become a true sanitation hero!<br>In this meditative arcade game, you control a guy with pressure stream to clean off mold that has taken over food, shelves, drawers and even the freezer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure stream mechanics. Aim, spray, and switch between different cleaning types. Blast away mold, push back enemies, and leave sparkling cleanliness behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied locations, dirty objects, and\u00a0rewards. Clean food, treasures, fridge, kitchen items, sewer stuff, and basements. Unlock new heroes, music, and cosmetic items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of dirt and mold to clean: colorful, iridescent, ghost, inverted, sticky, mimic, crystalline, glowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute\u00a0food heroes. You're not a knight or soldier, you\u2019re a healthy meal on a mission. Play as sensible meals determined to defeat mold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill soundtrack and satisfying cleaning sounds make for a strangely addictive and calming experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Clean moldy messes as a brave food hero! Equip your high-pressure spray, choose the right nozzle, and clear away sticky messes in this cozy, arcade-style fridge-cleaning adventure.",
